{"id": 199483, "field": "description", "ja": "あなたとペットは周囲に溶け込み、\n$N1分間不可視状態になります。\nその間、$N3秒毎に$N2％回復します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#3329"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
